      "input": "arr = [\"d\",\"b\",\"c\",\"b\",\"c\",\"a\"], k = 2",
      "output": "\"a\"",
      "explanation": "The only distinct strings in arr are \"d\" and \"a\".\n\"d\" appears 1st, so it is the 1st distinct string.\n\"a\" appears 2nd, so it is the 2nd distinct string.\nSince k == 2, \"a\" is returned."
    },
